{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-d5432cf82aa39b7e1c9b0da57089be819455e8d0 \"Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook.\"]].\n\nThe appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked and reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-6a15ef12af6f9e9182ed21b7b1603acfb7772334 \"Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline.\"]].\n\nThis implies a time limit for parking in these reserved bays until midday.  ","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the handbook's parking rule, the reserved spaces, and the time limit with exact citations from the handbook and appendix sources."}